input CLK1 CLK2 A
output Y CDC
instance ff1 DFF
instance ff2 DFF
instance ff3 DFF
instance buf1 BUF
instance and1 AND2
net n_clk1 driver CLK1 load ff1/CLK ff2/CLK
net n_clk2 driver CLK2 load ff3/CLK
net n_a driver A load ff1/D
net n_q1 driver ff1/Q load buf1/A
net n_b driver buf1/Z load ff2/D and1/A
net n_q2 driver ff2/Q load and1/B
net n_y driver and1/Z load Y
net n_cdc driver ff2/Q load ff3/D
net n_cdc_out driver ff3/Q load CDC
